  "notes": "Northern Hindko (of Hazara/Peshawar, Pakistan) Shahmukhi consonant inventory (Rensch, Hallberg & O'Leary 1992), sharing the extended Punjabi/Urdu Perso-Arabic letter set (retroflex ٹ ڈ ڑ, aspirate-marking ھ). Short vowels are unwritten (abjad); ا و ی carry long-vowel/glide values only, matching this repository's abjad input contract elsewhere. Word stress is not orthographically predictable and is exempt per quality_tiers.md. No WikiPron gold exists for hno, so the tier stays at skeleton pending a benchmark source.",
